{"type":"record","name":"CandleDirectionExportRecord","namespace":"com.optionsedge.contracts.cvdrelated","doc":"Topic context-tape.direction.candle-export, key barId. One record per live Direction decision joined with its closed candle (candle|barId on the commissioning topic) by barId (CandleDirectionExport.join in context-tape-service): candleStartMs/candleEndMs are the candle record startMs/endMs (the decision barEndMs equals candleEndMs), intendedSide is exactly LONG_DELTA, SHORT_DELTA or null (the producer word NONE is null), posture and veto are the decision labels or null, available is false exactly when unavailableReason (the decision unreadableReason) is non-null, ruleFired is the decision flag, and quality is exactly UNREADABLE, VETOED:<veto>, RULE_FIRED or NO_RULE (no score is defined). A record is never written for a pair the join refuses. The topic has no tombstones (neither source topic withdraws a decision or a candle).","fields":[{"name":"barId","type":"string"},{"name":"tradeDate","type":"string"},{"name":"candleStartMs","type":"long"},{"name":"candleEndMs","type":"long"},{"name":"intendedSide","type":["null","string"],"default":null},{"name":"posture","type":["null","string"],"default":null},{"name":"available","type":"boolean"},{"name":"unavailableReason","type":["null","string"],"default":null},{"name":"ruleFired","type":"boolean"},{"name":"veto","type":["null","string"],"default":null},{"name":"quality","type":"string"}]}